      "claim_id": "claim.dbp.mrdl.chlorine-dioxide.acute-violation",
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "subject": "Acute chlorine dioxide MRDL violation",
      "relation": {
        "operator": "eq",
        "regulatory_metric": "other"
      },
      "value": "A daily entrance sample exceeds the MRDL and on the following day one or more of the three distribution system samples exceed the MRDL; the system must take immediate corrective action to lower chlorine dioxide below the MRDL and notify the public under the subpart Q procedures for acute health risks, in addition to reporting to the State under 141.134",
